<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">RapidGNN: Communication Efficient Large-Scale Distributed Training of Graph Neural Networks 
<br class="ltx_break"></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
